[{"client_msg_id":"78021107-36D7-4EF8-B308-4C0DC9B8F2EC","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"なるほど","ts":"1637827642.101400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=XHwg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"077B8B6F-65F2-4C34-99A7-0E4E3A5C8399","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"あれ、timer消してもブロックされたのでfsのコールバックでブロックされている…？","ts":"1637827549.100700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"puS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37449ef0-caba-4a9c-a920-fa99beaf99a9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらくこういう感じになりそうです。","ts":"1637827511.099800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aJ3I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff7ef625-6133-4cfd-a33a-45e8fb133029","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```local uv = require('luv')\nlocal mpack = require('mpack')\n\nuv.new_work(function(dict_path)\n  -- fetch \u0026amp; sort \u0026amp; indexing\n\n  return require('mpack').Packer()(index)\nend, vim.schedule_wrap(function(data)\n  local index = mpack.Unpacker()(data)\n  print(vim.inspect(index))\nend)):queue(dict_path)```","ts":"1637827507.099600","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1637827543.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qRqI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b57f1004-e952-4e0d-99a4-d9d04ee72d7e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そういうワンショットの処理なら実際は無理でもないですが","ts":"1637827310.099400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eVsCY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b06e8c37-87d1-4e2c-936b-b890fe46a487","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なるほど〜〜〜。それは無理だあ。","ts":"1637827280.098800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nwg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55CAE034-E98C-4994-9CF5-D379F264C70C","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"あー、ファイルの読み込みはfsでやってるんですけど、そのあとcompleteを高速に処理出来るようにソートして対応するindexのtable作ってるんですよ","ts":"1637826633.098000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZxBI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"345003ca-ccc8-41d9-a1e2-30f63340650b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そちらだとパラレルになれそうです。","ts":"1637826467.096300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I29+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46716c6f-71ab-4a93-b178-a1d75f37b31b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"最初の読み込みだけであれば vim.loop.fs 系の API でコールバックで取得できるので","ts":"1637826456.096000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wqz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04400DD8-688A-4B94-9EF1-6283A1A4FEBB","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"最初の読み込みだけなのでまあ","ts":"1637826423.095500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"afmgc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad5056c2-3c31-4616-ae91-f17228a51a0f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"まあ、Lua の速度で 6s かかるようなものは非同期にしても使い物にならん気はしますが。。。","ts":"1637826276.095200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DMyU9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5467bdf-d644-4c20-98b5-ec148d4b6840","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"nvim-cmp の根本的に弱い部分ですよねえ。UI スレッドで動作しているので。。。","ts":"1637826201.094700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NOtPQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E5B669F3-B1A1-48CB-B3A6-A9ABE688D0ED","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"つらい","ts":"1637821843.094000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8jes"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BC5C3C01-E6D0-465F-8DFD-9A753B86D795","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"cmp-dictinaryでアホでかい辞書使ってる人がいるみたいで、6sくらいブロックされるんですよね…","ts":"1637821833.093800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iivF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28d035b4-d68d-44dc-bf65-09c30dea25ac","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"です。新の非同期を実現するには vim.loop.new_work や vim.loop.new_thread などを使う必要がありますが、これはめちゃくちゃ自由が低いので、自分で頑張って RPC 部分を書くしかないのが現状です。（本当にやりたいなら）","ts":"1637821797.093000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gunnyari","count":1,"users":["U02AJP5L75Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wUHJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24B5954F-237B-4228-9BB1-895998B7E8D6","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"非同期で処理するためにvim.loopのtimer使ってたんですが、これ渡した関数が実行されてる間操作ブロックされるんですね","ts":"1637821703.092100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EVorO"}]}]
